LiquidateTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given position is solvent
│   └── it should revert
├── given liquidator is not priority liquidator
│   ├── given position is not tagged
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── given position is tagged by liquidator
│   │   ├── when within priority grace period
│   │   │   └── it should revert
│   │   └── when after priority grace period
│   │       └── it should liquidate position
│   └── given position is tagged by other liquidator
│       ├── when within tagger grace period
│       │   └── it should revert
│       └── when after tagger grace period
│           └── it should liquidate position
└── given liquidator is priority liquidator
    ├── when current LTV is less than max liquidation LTV
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when current LTV is between max liquidation LTV and complete liquidation LTV
    │   └── it should liquidate partial position
    └── when current LTV is greater than complete liquidation LTV
        └── it should liquidate complete position 